s connected or joined to something. Naval says he had attached his well-being to pain, meaning his happiness was linked to suffering. Attached to can also mean emotionally close.", "exs": ["I'm really attached to my old phone.", "Don't attach your self-worth to one client's opinion."], "t": 150.11, "tt": {"w": 150.11, "ex": [["Attached", 152.98], ["means", 153.54], ["connected", 153.91], ["or", 154.54], ["joined", 154.73], ["to", 155.16], ["something.", 155.35], ["Naval", 156.04], ["says", 156.41], ["he", 156.73], ["had", 156.91], ["attached", 157.16], ["his", 157.73], ["well-being", 157.98], ["to", 158.66], ["pain,", 158.85], ["meaning", 159.23], ["his", 159.73], ["happiness", 159.98], ["was", 160.6], ["linked", 160.85], ["to", 161.29], ["suffering.", 161.48], ["Attached", 162.16], ["to", 162.73], ["can", 162.91], ["also", 163.16], ["mean", 163.48], ["emotionally", 163.79], ["close.", 164.54]], "exs": [[["I'm", 168.23], ["really", 168.52], ["attached", 168.9], ["to", 169.2], ["my", 169.36], ["old", 170.03], ["phone.", 170.03]], [["Don't", 171.38], ["attach", 171.5], ["your", 171.74], ["self-worth", 172.17], ["to", 172.6], ["one", 173.02], ["client's", 174.09], ["opinion.", 174.09]]]}}, {"n": 8, "w": "well-being", "pos": "n.", "zh": "幸福；身心健康", "ex": "Well-being means being healthy, comfortable and happy, in body and mind. Naval talks about his overall well-being and satisfaction. It's common in health and work talk.", "exs": ["Sleep is so important for your well-being.", "The company cares about employee well-being."], "t": 175.19, "tt": {"w": 175.19, "ex": [["Well-being", 178.03], ["means", 178.38], ["being", 178.68], ["healthy,", 178.96], ["comfortable", 180.22], ["and", 180.52], ["happy,", 180.52], ["in", 180.92], ["body", 181.29], ["and", 181.67], ["mind.", 182.04], ["Naval", 183.5], ["talks", 183.5], ["about", 183.8], ["his", 184.2], ["overall", 184.38], ["well-being", 184.98], ["and", 185.58], ["satisfaction.", 185.88], ["It's", 187.24], ["common", 187.44], ["